Package: geodensity
Title: Geodesic Kernel Density Estimation for Spatial Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Andrew", "Brown", , "brown.andrewg@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compute kernel density estimates on geographic data using geodesic distances.
    Combines the terra package's efficient raster processing with a parallelized Rust backend
    to deliver scalable, accurate density estimation for large geospatial datasets without.
